# An unterminated block comment points at where it starts.
mode: syntax
---- query
from t | take 1 /* note
| where x > 1
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..38
  PIPELINE@0..15
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    NAME_REF@5..6
      IDENT@5..6 "t"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PIPE@7..8 "|"
    WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
    TAKE_OP@9..15
      IDENT@9..13 "take"
      WHITESPACE@13..14 " "
      LITERAL@14..15
        LONG@14..15 "1"
  WHITESPACE@15..16 " "
  BLOCK_COMMENT@16..38 "/* note\n| where x > 1\n"

error[DS0006]: unterminated block comment
  --> query:1:17
  |
1 | from t | take 1 /* note
  |                 ^^ this comment is never closed
  |
  = help: close it with `*/`
  = note: block comments do not nest
